> 
> Unfortunately when I boot up OpenVMS 6.1, I cannot seem to mount or
> initialize.
> I get the error "Fatal Disk Error", which means nothing to me. The
> OpenVMS users
> guide doesn't seem to address the possibility of errors occurring
