   The well publicised shortfall in SPECint95 scores from DEC's
   usual ironclad predictions contrasts with how well the PA-8500
   is doing on SPECint95 with less integer execution resources).
   The PA-8500 is obviously benefitting from low average memory
   latency from the huge on chip L1.

