I don't know, but I *do* know that in our world (Numerical Weather
Forecasting) no one is using an SP2 for operational work (i.e. the 24x7
business).  No one uses Beowulfs, too - yet; however, based on the
uptime figures I've seen from Salmon et al, who introduced Beowulf at
Supercomputing '96, I am not particularly worried.

