The SPX card was made specifically to run DECwindows (aka Motif).  For
DECwindows, it is MUCH faster than the GPX.

If you are running UIS, I don't know if it makes much difference.

Also, the SPX supports 1280x1024 resolution.  Both the SPX and GPX
support 1024x864.

