: When booting Digital Unix (I added the itpsa and the psiop drivers) the kernel
: shows:

: May  5 09:44:58 cdl01 vmunix: itpsa0 at pci0 slot 12
: May  5 09:44:58 cdl01 vmunix: itpsa0: controller not found
: May  5 09:44:58 cdl01 vmunix:   attempting to use psiop...
: May  5 09:44:58 cdl01 vmunix: psiop0 at pci0 slot 12
